  "text": "Freelancers lose thousands every year simply by forgetting to log their hours. Switching between client Slack channels, browser tabs, and design files makes manual timers impossible to maintain accurately. Unrecorded fifteen-minute task increments slip through your calendar daily and vanish completely from final client invoices. Running Timely in your background tracks active desktop applications and automatically organizes billable slots using machine intelligence. You capture every billable dollar without extra stress.",
